@api = http://localhost:5090

### Valid comparison
POST {{api}}/api/loans/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanA": { "principal": 300000, "annualRatePercent": 6.5, "termYears": 30, "fees": 6000, "extraMonthlyPayment": 0 },
  "loanB": { "principal": 300000, "annualRatePercent": 6.125, "termYears": 30, "fees": 9000, "extraMonthlyPayment": 200 }
}

### Validation errors (400 with per-field messages)
POST {{api}}/api/loans/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanA": { "principal": 0, "annualRatePercent": 45, "termYears": 12, "fees": 0 },
  "loanB": null
}

### Malformed JSON (400 problem details)
POST {{api}}/api/loans/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{ "loanA": { "principal": "lots" } }
